1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,459
This is one Claude Code session.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:04,592
Every agent is a person at a desk.

3
00:00:04,593 --> 00:00:06,898
They walk in when they're spawned.

4
00:00:06,899 --> 00:00:09,119
A cloud is a real thinking block.

5
00:00:11,259 --> 00:00:13,838
They walk over to report.

6
00:00:13,839 --> 00:00:16,118
Red is REFUTED.

7
00:00:16,119 --> 00:00:18,239
Green is CONFIRMED.

8
00:00:20,479 --> 00:00:22,699
They finish, and they leave.

9
00:00:22,721 --> 00:00:25,018
More agents than chairs.

10
00:00:25,019 --> 00:00:26,998
The ones without a desk are real too.

11
00:00:26,999 --> 00:00:29,478
Every agent's tokens, cache and cost.

12
00:00:29,479 --> 00:00:31,758
Who spent what, at a glance.

13
00:00:31,759 --> 00:00:33,938
Every token the session billed.

14
00:00:33,939 --> 00:00:36,218
Every tool call, as it runs.

15
00:00:36,219 --> 00:00:38,698
Rewind to any second.

16
00:00:38,699 --> 00:00:40,878
Two sessions. Two tabs.

17
00:00:40,879 --> 00:00:42,958
Every action, by name.

18
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:44,938
Day or night.

19
00:00:44,939 --> 00:00:46,959
Press ? and it explains itself.

20
00:00:49,219 --> 00:00:52,419
Read-only. Local. It never talks to an API.
Built almost entirely by the agents it watches.
Free and MIT: github.com/Kostakurta8/roundtable
